<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0001> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/TextUnit>.
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Short-term MCS should be considered in patients with cardiogenic shock as a BTR, BTD, BTB. Further indications include treatment of the cause of cardiogenic shock or long-term MCS or transplantation.".
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasLocator> <http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0001/locator>.
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasExtractedEntity> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/e_0001>.
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasExtractedEntity> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/e_0002>.
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasExtractedEntity> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/e_0003>.
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasExtractedEntity> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/e_0004>.
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasExtractedEntity> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/e_0005>.
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasNormativeAssertion> <http://digistrucmed.org/normative-assertion/na_0001>.
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasSourceGradeRecord> <http://digistrucmed.org/grade-record/gr_0001>.
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0001> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasSourceGradeRecord> <http://digistrucmed.org/grade-record/gr_0002>.
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0002> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/TextUnit>.
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0002> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "IABP may be considered in patients with cardiogenic shock as a BTR, BTD, BTB, including treatment of the cause of cardiogenic shock (i.e. mechanical complication of acute MI) or long-term MCS or transplantation. 450".
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0002> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasLocator> <http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0002/locator>.
