<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0002> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasExtractedEntity> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/e_0009>.
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0002> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasExtractedEntity> <http://digistrucmed.org/entity-mention/e_0010>.
