<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0002> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasSourceGradeRecord> <http://digistrucmed.org/grade-record/gr_0003>.
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0002> <http://digistrucmed.org/hasSourceGradeRecord> <http://digistrucmed.org/grade-record/gr_0004>.
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0003> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://digistrucmed.org/TextUnit>.
<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/tu_0003> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "IABP is not routinely recommended in post-MI cardiogenic shock. 500–502".
